@startuml
title CampusEnroll HA - Flujo de eventos planificado

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "enrollment-service" as enrollment #FCF3CF
queue "Exchange\ncampusenroll.enrollment.exchange" as ex_enrollment #FCF3CF
queue "Queue\ncampusenroll.billing.enrollment-created.q" as q_enrollment_created #FCF3CF

component "billing-service" as billing #FCF3CF
queue "Exchange\ncampusenroll.billing.exchange" as ex_billing #FCF3CF
queue "Queue\ncampusenroll.notification.billing-created.q" as q_billing_created #FCF3CF
queue "Queue\ncampusenroll.notification.billing-paid.q" as q_billing_paid #FCF3CF
queue "Queue\ncampusenroll.notification.requested.q" as q_notification_requested #FCF3CF

component "notification" as notification #FCF3CF

note top
Mensajeria planificada y no implementada por completo.
Los exchanges, queues y routing keys incluidos aqui
son placeholders propuestos para la entrega final.
end note

enrollment --> ex_enrollment : EnrollmentCreated\nrouting key: enrollment.created
ex_enrollment --> q_enrollment_created
q_enrollment_created --> billing : consumidor propuesto

billing --> ex_billing : BillingCreated\nrouting key: billing.created
billing --> ex_billing : BillingPaid\nrouting key: billing.paid
billing --> ex_billing : NotificationRequested\nrouting key: notification.requested

ex_billing --> q_billing_created
ex_billing --> q_billing_paid
ex_billing --> q_notification_requested

q_billing_created --> notification : consumir BillingCreated
q_billing_paid --> notification : consumir BillingPaid
q_notification_requested --> notification : consumir NotificationRequested

note bottom of billing
La emision de eventos por billing-service
queda pendiente de integracion AMQP real.
end note

note bottom of notification
notification aun no tiene consumidores implementados;
hoy solo responde al health check.
end note

@enduml
